OL,3,GNEWSAPolice chief says justice too late
OL,4,Afor shop theft
OL,5,
OL,6,FJustice for shoplifters comes "too
OL,7,Flate" because of delays in the system
OL,8,Fand should be a funding priority, a
OL,9,Fchief constable has said.
OL,11,FPaul Sanford, who leads Norfolk Police,
OL,12,Fpraised the work of officers but said
OL,13,Finvestment was needed in speeding up
OL,14,Fsentencing for offenders.
OL,16,FHis comments come after Home Office
OL,17,Fdata showed shoplifting offences
OL,18,Fdropped by 10% in the county in 2025/26
OL,19,Fcompared with the previous year. The
OL,20,Fforce remained the most successful for
OL,21,Fidentifying suspects.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
