OL,3,GNEWSAPolice chief says justice too late
OL,4,Afor shop theft
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I think the thing that concerns me
OL,7,Fmost is that, too often, the sanction
OL,8,Fis too late after the crime," he told
OL,9,FBBC Radio Norfolk.
